"use": "百貨店 / 駅ビル (Shinjuku class): 72 x 48 m, seven storeys, enterable (_Shop) -- F1 the food hall (デパ地下 brought up: the island has no basement below sea level), F2 cosmetics, F3-F4 fashion, F5 household goods, F6 books, F7 the restaurant floor, a roof garden; two escalator atriums, two lift banks (back and front), four corner stairs, WC blocks each floor, five entrances and a long street canopy. probe_xz is between the east atrium's escalators. kits/interiors/DepartmentStore.blend (the artist's; a PLACEHOLDER shell and fit-out, ARTIST_NOTES.md lists what to replace)",
